---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: About
permalink: /about/
ogImage: /img/about/corrales-sunset.jpg
---
<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h1>About {{ business.name }}</h1>
    <p>{{ business.tagline }}</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section section--tint-green">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2>Our Approach</h2>
    <p>
      Clients meet with support staff to identify needs, goals, and obstacles. Goals
      and services are meant to promote recovery, rehabilitation, and resiliency by
      addressing the barriers that impede the development of skills necessary for
      independent functioning in the community. Clients are assigned a support team
      to help them reach these goals by coordinating desired client services to
      support a comprehensive and collaborative service plan. Clients receive this
      through practicing new skills, helping them monitor their progress, assisting
      with their treatment, modeling effective coping techniques, and self-help
      strategies. Peer Support Specialists (PSS) focus on various therapeutic and
      supportive tasks emphasizing self-advocacy. Community Support Workers (CSWs)
      connect clients to available resources and provide assistance and support.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrapper about-photo-block">
    <img src="/img/about/corrales-sunset.jpg" alt="Rio Grande valley at sunset, New Mexico" width="2000" height="1334">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section section--tint-blue">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2>Why {{ business.name }}?</h2>
    <p>
      Staff is dedicated to providing each client with the individualized and
      collaborative care they deserve. Our team of professionals has over ten years
      of experience in the Southern New Mexico region with master's degrees in
      psychology, social work, and curriculum and instruction. Our services are
      designed to provide clients with the support needed to establish a personal
      foundation to grow. Together, we work toward developing the necessary skills
      and connecting to available resources needed to live independent and
      fulfilling lives.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

{% if team.list.length %}
<div class="section">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2>Team</h2>
    <div class="services-grid">
      {% for member in team.list %}
      <div class="service-card">
        {% if member.photo %}<img src="{{ member.photo }}" alt="{{ member.name }}">{% endif %}
        <h3>{{ member.name }}</h3>
        <p><em>{{ member.role }}</em></p>
        <p>{{ member.bio | safe }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}
